12. Improvements I strongly recommend
Use worker naming as the bridge between physical asset and pool revenue.

Example:

client01.KIL-CT01-R08-S03-P12-CTM000123
That lets you trace:

client

site

rack

slot

miner ID

pool revenue

Also add a quarantine VLAN. Any miner with unknown MAC, duplicate MAC, wrong firmware, wrong pool, or unknown owner should not be allowed into production until approved.

Finally, build the system around events, not just current status:

Miner received
Miner tested
Miner failed
Miner repaired
Miner passed
Miner deployed
Miner went offline
Miner removed
Miner scrapped
That gives you a full lifecycle record and makes client reporting, warranty claims, repair analysis, and revenue attribution much easier.


