Suggested control modes
Manual mode
System recommends. Operator applies.

Best for MVP.

Approval mode
System suggests tuning changes, supervisor approves.

Best for early field deployment.

Auto mode
System automatically changes profiles within approved limits.

Best once stable.

Important rule
Do not just optimize for hashrate. Optimize for:

profit per watt + reliability + repair cost + available power
A less efficient miner may still be worth running when power is cheap or stranded. A high-hash miner may not be worth running if it overheats, fails often, or consumes limited power that a better unit could use.




